      "english_translation": "About ten years ago, that house was occupied by a wealthy family."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "japanese": "でも、ある日、泥棒がその家に入り、その家のお金や宝石をすべて盗んだうえに、家族を全員殺してしまったらしい。",
      "english_translation": "However, one day, a thief broke into the house and stole all of its money and jewels, as well as killing everyone in the family."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "でも、ぼくのおじいちゃんが、そう言っていた。",
      "english_translation": "But, my grandfather said so."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "japanese": "おじいちゃんは、低くてこわい声でゆっくりその話をしたから、ぼくはほとんど泣きそうになってしまったけど、なんとかがまんした。",
      "english_translation": "My grandfather told me the story in a low, scary voice and slowly, so I almost cried. But I managed to hold it back."
    }
